#: src/Composer/Submission.cpp:180
msgctxt "Submission|"
msgid ""
"The IMAP connection has disappeared. You'll have close the composer, save "
"the draft and re-open it later. The attachments will have to be added later. "
"Sorry for the trouble, please see <a "
"href=\"https://projects.flaska.net/issues/640\">https://projects.flaska.net/issues/640</a> "
"for details."
msgstr "IMAP veza je prekinuta. Zatvorite sastavljač poruka, spremite skicu i ponovno je otvorite kasnije. Privitke ćete morati dodati naknadno. Ispričavamo se zbog neugodnosti; pojedinosti potražite na adresi <a href=\"https://projects.flaska.net/issues/640\">https://projects.flaska.net/issues/640</a>."
"IMAP veza je prekinuta. Morat ćete zatvoriti uređivač poruke, spremiti "
"skicu i poslije je ponovno otvoriti. Privitke ćete morati dodati naknadno. "
"Ispričavamo se zbog poteškoća; pojedinosti potražite na stranici "
"<a href=\"https://projects.flaska.net/issues/640\">https://projects.flaska.net/issues/640</a>."

